{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ShiftFlow 是一款供輪班工作者使用的離線輪班日曆，可自行建立重複班次，將日班、夜班與休息日集中呈現，適合需要掌握作息與提醒的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-2.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂輪班與本地提醒</h2>\n<p>可建立最多 60 天、20 種班次的輪班表，集中查看日班、夜班與休息日，並支援跨日班次、備註及本地提醒。你可設定班次開始前 15、30、60 或 120 分鐘提示，分享每月班表圖片，透過統計與小工具掌握工時和休息日。資料保存在裝置，無需帳戶，並可匯出 JSON 備份。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-12-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-13-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-14-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-15-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-16-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ShiftFlow: Rotation Calendar</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/shiftflow-rotation-calendar/id6818828064?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.335502+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T18:49:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:10.295608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:10.295608+00:00","content_hash":"7ed5ca5bcd553fea08dd9ea82b892afc98856046b89882e390bc8b20f8455740","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}